# Product Integrity (MVP Preview)

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-product-integrity.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-product-integrity.md) · Preview: [`docs/13-infrastructure/preview-qualification.md`](../../docs/13-infrastructure/preview-qualification.md)

## Prove

SolenOS behaves as a **Care Reality / Living Care Record** system — never chatbot, document summarizer, or task manager.

## Final test

Tired caregiver feels *situation organized* — not *another AI tool*.

## Enforce

- Meaning before information · change as unit · preserve unknowns · no false continuity  
- Never task-ify early · no engagement tricks · situation before solution  
- Caregiver UI: no enums · no confidence % · no engine chrome · no hollow dashboards  
- Hollow “what matters” / recognition-only responses must fail midnight + acceptance gates  

## Do not

Add components, labels, cards, or explanations to “improve UX” or look advanced.  
Weaken `verify:product-path` to pass.

**Gate:** `npm run verify:product-path` (includes midnight test, intelligence validation, MVP response behavior — not optional)  
